  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"Kupa Be\u015Flisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nEn
    kritik noktada bu nas\u0131l bir vazge\xE7i\u015Ftir {{isim}}? Se\xE7ti\u011Fin
    kart, herkes \"yapamazs\u0131n\" derken ve u\u011Fra\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    i\u015Flerde sona yakla\u015Fm\u0131\u015Fken, bu defa senin inanc\u0131n\u0131
    yitirmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor. \"Nas\u0131l iptal
    etsem, ne yapsam da vazge\xE7sem, en kestirme neresinden d\xF6nsem?\" diye d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsun.
    Se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart, hedefledi\u011Fin \u015Feyi g\xF6zden \xE7\u0131karmaya
    ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret ediyor. Ama\xE7lad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    noktaya varamadan pes etmende ge\xE7mi\u015Finin de etkileri oldu\u011Funu g\xF6r\xFCyorum.
    Benzeri ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131klar ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F olabilirsin.
    Onlar\u0131 hat\u0131rlay\u0131p, ayn\u0131 sonu\xE7lar\u0131 alaca\u011F\u0131n
    endi\u015Fesiyle havlu atmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yorsun. Bunu yapmamal\u0131s\u0131n."
